# Annotations declare shape, matrix properties, and the unit of the
# elements. Without a value the name is an input, taken on trust.
t: s
v: Vector[3] m/s
A: PositiveDefinite Matrix[N, N]
K: Symmetric Diagonal Matrix[3, 3] N/m
x: Scalar
M: Tensor[B, T, D] kg
f: N
temp: K
Q: Orthogonal Matrix[3, 3]
